              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msyene licinga akaŵika nyama jakusakala pa nambala ja likumi, kuti jisagulidwe, kapena akatindanya. Naga akutindanya nyama jine ni nyama jine, nyama siŵili syosopesyo siŵe syawo AMBUJE, nipo syangakomboleka kusiwombola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
